%% Symbols: coordinator/api/provider_codeattest.go, coordinator/api/code_attest_throttle.go,
%% coordinator/apns/attestor.go, coordinator/registry/registry.go.
sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Provider (signed app, Aqua session)
    participant K as Coordinator
    participant A as Apple APNs

    P->>K: register {public_key K, apns_device_token, apns_environment, attestation}
    Note over K: codeAttestLoop waits for this connection's first signed attestation_challenge
    alt durable proof for (SE key, version, APNs token, K) younger than reuseWindow = 30m,<br/>or an approved cross-version release transition
        K->>P: code_attestation_resume_challenge {code_challenge = nonce sealed to K}
        P->>K: code_attestation_response {nonce, signature} within resumeTimeout = 30s
    else push (maxAttempts = 3 per loop)
        K->>K: throttle: backgroundPushCooldown 20m / alertPushCooldown 75s per device,<br/>retrySpacing 15s + jitter [0, 15s), budgetClearCooldown 20m
        K->>A: POST /3/device/{token}<br/>{aps: {content-available: 1}, code_challenge: {ephemeral_public_key, ciphertext}}<br/>apns-topic io.darkbloom.provider · apns-push-type background · apns-priority 5<br/>apns-expiration now + 300s · JWT ES256 cached jwtMaxAge = 50m
        A->>P: delivery to the Team-ID-signed bundle with aps-environment
        P->>K: code_attestation_response {nonce, signature}<br/>nonce accepted for challengeValidity = 300s
    end
    Note over K: handleCodeAttestationResponse: nonce matches the challenge recorded for<br/>this SE key + APNs token + K — ECDSA verified with the registration SE key<br/>GrantProcessCodeAttested refuses if K or the token rotated
    K->>K: persistCodeAttestation (se_pubkey_hash, apns_token_hash, process_key, attested_at)
    Note over K: enforcement: APNS_ENFORCE_AFTER (RFC 3339) reached ∧ attestor configured<br/>→ providerSupportsPrivateTextLocked requires CodeAttested
